# Copy to `.env` and fill in. `.env` is gitignored and carried between the
# admin's machines by Syncthing, like the rest of the deploy-side private
# config. `yarn pulumi`, `yarn preview` and `yarn deploy` load it for the command
# they run, so nothing here has to be in a shell's environment — and the loader
# and the state directory are `Pulumi.yaml`'s, not variables at all.

# Protects stack config only — no secret value ever enters state, so this is a
# low-drama secret. Paste it from 1Password (`op://<your vault>/keel/password`,
# the vault being the one `src/config/installation.ts` names).
PULUMI_CONFIG_PASSPHRASE=
